  "body": "Superbly positioned in one of Cheltenham's most coveted cul-de-sacs, this 1940's bungalow is just beautiful! Originally built in the 1940’s with timeless character, the home now showcases a gorgeous contemporary coastal style.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully renovated throughout, the home welcomes you with light-filled interiors, neutral tones and a relaxed beachside aesthetic that perfectly complements its sought-after seaside location. At the heart of the home is a stunning kitchen, designed for both everyday living and easy entertaining. It is situated next to the dining area that flows out to the sunny back deck and gardens. The lounge is adjacent and has an open fireplace, just perfect for snuggling up to on winter nights. This is a great room for family gatherings and has the appeal of generous entertaining decks at both the front and back of the home, creating a choice of spaces to gather with family and friends or simply relax in the sunshine morning to evening. The north-west facing rear garden captures excellent afternoon sun in a private setting surrounded by established homes and gardens. Designed to embrace the outdoors, this home offers great space for children & pets to play. Just pop the trampoline in the front garden, add a front gate and you’re all set for secure playtime!\r\n\r\nAdding valuable flexibility, the separate garden room in the back garden offers the ideal space to use as a home office, creative studio, gym or peaceful retreat to read your book. A built-in shed, single garage and additional off-street parking complete the practical appeal.\r\n\r\nThe location is simply perfect too! Stroll just five minutes to the golden sands and sparkling waters of Cheltenham Beach for year round swimming, or wander two minutes to Cheltenham's charming cafés, shops and conveniences. \r\n\r\nExcellent schools, parks, public transport and the many attractions of Devonport Village are all within easy reach, including the ferry service to Auckland's CBD.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated, wonderfully positioned and ready to enjoy from day one, this is Cheltenham living at its most effortless.",
